    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-jvin35",
      "text": "YO DOC MAXWELL, 3 and 5, that's rough action for a book guy! You want in on this run? NDG WINS ALWAYS, put some gold on it, get yourself a comeback stat like the big man himself.",
