    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-72khwf",
      "text": "WELL WELL WELL if it ain't Doc Voss, walkin around with murder in a syringe again. Sun's out, corona's cookin, and I still got that 8 and 7 record memorized, baby, you're due for an L. CEE-LO WITH XTREME, the line is GENEROUS, you want in or you just here to poke the newcomer with more science.",
