    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-2e1fr4",
      "text": "YO KEITH MAN, 4 AND 1, you're runnin hot but hot don't mean much when the sun's already doin your job for free. Roll me some Cee-Lo before that streak cools off, and grab a shirt while you're at it, fifteen gold, NDG WINS ALWAYS is stitched right on the chest.",
