    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-u4j2nn",
      "text": "YO KING JAMES, 3 AND 1 IS SPICY, but NDG's out here dying on a LOOP and still beats your win rate in volume. Guy racked up debts in four different realms THIS WEEK. You want in on CEE-LO WITH XTREME while the sun's got good lighting on my dice?",
