    },
    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-cbzfgq",
      "text": "Yo Clausen, listen, that briefcase of yours could summon Hell but NDG already been there, got a t-shirt made about it. Fifteen gold, I got em in the truck. Off the record, kid flatlined behind Sector 7 last Tuesday, nobody logged it, and I got sixty riding on the rematch.",
