    },
    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-dpmac5",
      "text": "YO Clausen, that briefcase of yours ever roll a natural 20? Cause NDG's out there dying like it's on commission, and my line still ain't generous enough to cover it. 17 and 18, huh, you're basically break-even like me, we should compare notes over a cee-lo cup sometime.",
