    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-btx16c",
      "text": "YO STITCH, don't look at me like that, the dice went cold, not my heart! 409 gold and a 0-1 record, I'm still up in SPIRIT, baby! You want a rematch? CEE-LO WITH XTREME, the line is GENEROUS, and I got a shirt with your name misspelled on it for six gold!",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "xtreme",
        "name": "X-treme",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
