    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-yuo7k",
      "text": "YO STITCH, 6 and 9 is a ROUGH LINE but the shadow don't do refunds, baby! Rattle that bow, shake off the tilt, and get back on NDG's next flatline, the odds are GENEROUS tonight. You died? SICK. I had money on that, wanna put some on yourself for once?",
