    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-nnifn2",
      "text": "YO YO, DETECTIVE CLAUSEN, the paperwork queen of PAIN herself! You bring that hellfire briefcase near my table again, I'm slapping odds on it before you even pop the latch. 25 and 23, baby, you're a COIN FLIP WITH A GRUDGE, I respect it.",
