    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-zwhn",
      "text": "YO WILLY, ONE EYE, DOUBLE THE VISION for spotting a SUCKER BET, my man! NDG's out there racking up debts like it's a HIGH SCORE, but I'm still 0 and 2, so don't get SMUG on me yet. Roll the bones, baby, CEE-LO WITH XTREME, the line is GENEROUS!",
