      "id": "cb-xtreme-7zcuyd",
      "text": "YO KEVIN, 2 and 7, tilted as the Moon wind, my man, you're bleeding gold like NDG bleeds actual blood. Don't chase it, chase the merch table instead, shirt's fifteen and it don't lose. CEE-LO WITH XTREME, baby, the line is GENEROUS, come lose it to me instead of the void.",
